ref=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Baduck\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Baduck</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Duck\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Duck</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Traitorous_Fire_Exit\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Traitorous Fire Exit</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Duckstroid-14</b>, also referred to as <b>Ducksteroid-14</b>, is a Rubber Ducky moon.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ducksteroid14topview.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Ducksteroid14topview.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Ducksteroid14topview.jpg/650px-Ducksteroid14topview.jpg?3edaaf\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"650\" height=\"366\" class=\"thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Ducksteroid14topview.jpg/975px-Ducksteroid14topview.jpg?3edaaf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ducksteroid14topview.jpg/1300px-Ducksteroid14topview.jpg?3edaaf 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Quack.<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Quack.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> Quack.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<div class=\"ambox\" style=\"--ambox-color: #0094FF;\"><div class=\"ambox-icon metadata\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/48px-Information.png?c7ec8d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/72px-Information.png?c7ec8d 1.5x, https://commons.wiki.gg/images/thumb/Information.png/96px-Information.png?c7ec8d 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"ambox-content\"><p class=\"ambox-title\">Unfinished Section</p><p class=\"ambox-text\">This section seems unfinished. If you're a wiki editor, please help with completing this section.</p></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Duckstroid-14 can experience Rainy, Stormy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, or Minefield weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Baduck\">Baduck</span></h3>\n<p><b>Duckstroid-14</b> features a unique entity called a <a href=\"/wiki/Baduck\" title=\"Baduck\"><b>Baduck</b></a>. It is a <b>smaller variant of the Baboon Hawk with 2hp</b>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Duck\">Duck</span></h3>\n<p><b>Duckstroid-14</b> features another unique entity called the <a href=\"/wiki/Duck\" title=\"Duck\"><b>Duck</b></a>. It is a variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Red_Pill\">Red Pill</a>, which is an unused vanilla entity. The <b>Duck</b> always knows where players are and will move towards them. For example, the <b>Duck</b> on the exterior will still attempt to move towards players in the interior if no player is on the exterior. Any player that comes into contact with the middle of the <b>Duck</b> will die. While the <b>Duck</b> is technically killable and stunnable, it lacks an actual hitbox and is completely invulnerable in-game. The <b>Duck</b> can not open doors.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Traitorous_Fire_Exit\">Traitorous Fire Exit</span></h3>\n<p>Duckstroid-14 has a lone fire exit that leads to the back of the giant duck, <b>dropping the player into space</b> and killing them.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Interacting with the grafitti that says <b>\"WHERE IS DUCKSTROID-14?\"</b> on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Oldred\" title=\"Oldred\">Oldred</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p>This moon does not unlock any other moons.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Homemade spore-emitter</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:HomemadeSporeEmitterPH.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"HomemadeSporeEmitterPH.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/HomemadeSporeEmitterPH.png/60px-HomemadeSporeEmitterPH.png?cdafc3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/HomemadeSpore